        {
          "semanticId": "PTX-AND-SEM2-056",
          "classification": "DESIGN_DEPENDENCY",
          "statement": "Value domain design (architecture D-11, D-3): the value domain for .b32 is proposed as a fixed-width 32-bit untyped bit-value domain, because .b32 is the 'Bits (untyped)' basic type (CTX-04) and the family size-matching note permits operands of any 32-bit type.",
